{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BACKROOMS: LIMINAL ESCAPE</strong> is a VHS-style horror game set in the eerie liminal spaces of the Backrooms. Featuring stunning photorealistic graphics and intense, engaging gameplay, it delivers a thrilling and immersive experience.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657530/extras/br2.gif?t=1745869112\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike a typical Backrooms walking simulator, <strong>BACKROOMS: LIMINAL ESCAPE</strong> keeps you on edge with moments where you\u2019ll need to run, hide, stay silent, and more to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657530/extras/BR1.gif?t=1745869112\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a wide variety of maps, each carefully crafted to stay true to Backrooms lore. Every level adds depth to the mystery and horror of these haunting liminal spaces. You can also disable the VHS effect for an entirely different game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657530/extras/br3.gif?t=1745869112\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657530?t=1745869112","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657530?t=1745869112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657530/4053f33fb3f84f46465456b51c50a8fa3a6919eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745869112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657530/4053f33fb3f84f46465456b51c50a8fa3a6919eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745869112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BACKROOMS: LIMINAL ESCAPE</strong> is a VHS-style horror game set in the eerie liminal spaces of the Backrooms. Featuring stunning photorealistic graphics and intense, engaging gameplay, it delivers a thrilling and immersive experience.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657530/extras/br2.gif?t=1745869112\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike a typical Backrooms walking simulator, <strong>BACKROOMS: LIMINAL ESCAPE</strong> keeps you on edge with moments where you\u2019ll need to run, hide, stay silent, and more to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657530/extras/BR1.gif?t=1745869112\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a wide variety of maps, each carefully crafted to stay true to Backrooms lore. Every level adds depth to the mystery and horror of these haunting liminal spaces. You can also disable the VHS effect for an entirely different game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657530/extras/br3.gif?t=1745869112\" /></p>","developers":["kc6067"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657530/87f5637d203702ddc10cf738d2319050f6f6e9c3/header.jpg?t=1745869112","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129919,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129919/movie480.mp4?t=1745428077","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129919/movie_max.mp4?t=1745428077"},"name":"